eractive elements that make them a cherished addition to the collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strengthen Bonds</strong>: Every Eternal added to the collection brings “Glory Points” and personal lore, allowing Seekers to learn about their history, likes, and quirks. These bonds grow stronger over time, unlocking rare items, special moments, and new insights into Eternia’s history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in the Eternal Marketplace</strong>: Through the Steam marketplace, Seekers can trade and connect, exchanging waifus and husbandos to diversify their collections and share with other Seekers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>🚀 Join us on the journey</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each Char is inspired by the community on our discord. Come hang out with us and let's grow into something more awesome!</p>",
